{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wail - Demo Version</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the eerie world of <i>Wail</i> with this exclusive demo, offering a glimpse into the dark, cursed forest. This is not the full experience\u2014far from it. In this early preview, you\u2019ll get to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn how to use the key items that will be crucial to your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore and uncover the first 20-30 minutes of gameplay, including some of the forest\u2019s haunting locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the tense atmosphere and start piecing together hints about the curse that lingers over the forest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please note, this is a work-in-progress version, and many features are still being developed. Expect more content, deeper mechanics, and polished gameplay in the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your feedback is invaluable to us, so share your thoughts and help shape the final experience. Dare to wishlist <i>Wail</i> and prepare for the full horror that awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you survive the forest\u2019s cursed night?</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792180/extras/KeepHerAwayENG.gif?t=1749901007\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792180?t=1749901007","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3792180?t=1749901007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792180/ae53a2d04b42f6c0361b565210523923fd85ba3d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749901007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3792180/ae53a2d04b42f6c0361b565210523923fd85ba3d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749901007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},